#User Stories:
US01: As a Customer Support Representative, I want the Email Router system to automatically categorize incoming messages based on urgency and content so that I can focus on addressing complex customer inquiries efficiently.
US02: As a Subject Matter Expert (SME), I want the Email Router system to intelligently route complex communications to me based on my expertise so that I can provide accurate and timely responses to inquiries within my field.
US03: As an IT Administrator, I want the Email Router system to provide a dashboard displaying performance metrics and system settings so that I can monitor and manage the system effectively.

# Product Features:
Feature Name: Email Routing and Categorization
Description: This feature focuses on the intelligent routing and categorization of incoming emails based on urgency, content, and expertise.
Key Functionality:
- Automatically categorize incoming messages based on urgency and content
- Intelligently route complex communications to Subject Matter Experts (SMEs) based on their expertise
User Benefit: Users can efficiently address customer inquiries and provide accurate responses within their field of expertise.
User Stories: [US01, US02]


Feature Name: Dashboard for Performance Monitoring
Description: This feature provides IT Administrators with a dashboard displaying performance metrics and system settings for effective monitoring and management of the Email Router system.
Key Functionality:
- Display performance metrics related to email routing and categorization
- Provide access to system settings for configuration and management
User Benefit: IT Administrators can monitor system performance and manage settings effectively to ensure smooth operation of the Email Router system.
User Stories: [US03]



# Development Tasks:
Task ID: US01-DEV01
Task Title: Develop email categorization module
Related User Story: User Story ID 01
Description: Create a module that analyzes incoming email messages and categorizes them based on urgency and content.
Acceptance Criteria: Messages are accurately categorized based on predefined criteria.
Estimated Effort: 5 days
Dependencies: None

Task ID: US01-DEV02
Task Title: Design user interface for categorized messages
Related User Story: User Story ID 01
Description: Design a user interface for Customer Support Representatives to view categorized messages.
Acceptance Criteria: User interface displays categorized messages clearly and is intuitive to use.
Estimated Effort: 3 days
Dependencies: US01-DEV01

Task ID: US02-DEV01
Task Title: Implement expertise matching algorithm
Related User Story: User Story ID 02
Description: Develop an algorithm to match incoming emails with Subject Matter Experts based on their expertise.
Acceptance Criteria: Emails are accurately matched with the appropriate Subject Matter Experts.
Estimated Effort: 5 days
Dependencies: None

Task ID: US02-DEV02
Task Title: Set up email forwarding system for Subject Matter Experts
Related User Story: User Story ID 02
Description: Establish a system to automatically forward emails to the matched Subject Matter Experts.
Acceptance Criteria: Emails are promptly and accurately forwarded to the designated Subject Matter Experts.
Estimated Effort: 3 days
Dependencies: US02-DEV01

Task ID: US03-DEV01
Task Title: Develop dashboard for performance metrics and system settings
Related User Story: User Story ID 03
Description: Create a dashboard to display performance metrics and system settings for the Email Router system.
Acceptance Criteria: Dashboard provides real-time performance data and allows IT Administrators to manage system settings effectively.
Estimated Effort: 4 days
Dependencies: None

